<title>UK: John Lewis UK dept store sales up 4.4% in last wk.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK dept store sales up 4.4% in last wk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said on Friday its UK department store sales rose 4.4 percent in the week to March 29 versus the same week last year.</p>
<p>In the nine weeks to March 29, sales were up 8.3 percent compared with that period a year ago.</p>
<p>Total sales were up 11.7 percent in the week to March 29, and rose 7.2 percent over the nine weeks to March 29.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 2774</p>
